# 强制 LF 行尾（Windows 上 git 偶尔弹 "LF will be replaced by CRLF" 警告）
# .jhyy 源码 / .md 文档 当前就是 LF，attribute 只是显式声明
*.jhyy   text eol=lf
*.md     text eol=lf
*.c      text eol=lf
*.h      text eol=lf
*.py     text eol=lf
*.json   text eol=lf
*.txt    text eol=lf
*.sh     text eol=lf
*.ini    text eol=lf
Makefile text eol=lf
# ⚠️ 2026-10-30:原 qbe/ 那两条规则(`qbe/** text eol=lf` + `qbe/*.exe binary`)
# 已随 qbe/ 目录整体删除而移除。留个记录:那条 `qbe/** text eol=lf` glob 把
# qbe/qbe.exe 也圈进了「文本」,二进制被做换行转换 → 损坏(实测差 31 字节,
# 症状 "not compatible with the version of Windows you're running"),
# 曾把 v4.0.6 的 release 卡死。**教训:glob 规则要精确到扩展名,别整目录套。**
*.exe      binary
*.dll      binary
*.so       binary
*.o        binary
*.obj      binary
*.a        binary
*.lib      binary
*.pdb      binary
*.zip      binary
*.7z       binary